  "obligation": "Execute ref.test and ref.cast through shared declaration matching, preserving nullability, exactness, original foreign callable identity and traps.",
  "representation": "ReferenceTarget encodes the source module heap-type index or abstract heap type plus named nullable/defined/exact flags. The graph remains in the existing program authority. Two appended opcodes use the same pure reference predicate as boundary decoding; test returns I32 and cast preserves the original Value or emits typed CastFailure. Registration rejects targets absent from the attached graph before instance effects. Residual format57 rejects older encodings. No constant pool, cell, side map, copied graph or executor is added.",
